<html>
<head>
<title>Apollo Knowledge Notification</title>

<!-- Forces Windows to use modern scaling -->
<meta http-equiv="x-ua-compatible" content="ie=edge">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<HTA:APPLICATION 
    ID="objWelcome" 
    APPLICATIONNAME="ApolloKnowledge_Info" 
    SCROLL="no" 
    SINGLEINSTANCE="yes" 
    WINDOWSTATE="normal"
    NAVIGABLE="no"
    SHOWINTASKBAR="yes"
    SYSMENU="no"
    BORDER="dialog">

<script>
    // Increased window size for the new layout and FAQ content
    var windowWidth = 700;
    var windowHeight = 650;
    window.resizeTo(windowWidth, windowHeight);

    // Calculate center of the screen
    var xPos = (screen.width - windowWidth) / 2;
    var yPos = (screen.height - windowHeight) / 2;
    window.moveTo(xPos, yPos);
</script>

<style>
    :root {
        --apollo-teal: #11809F;
        --apollo-green: #84B04C;
        --apollo-gold: #F5B62A;
    }

    body { 
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; 
        background-color: #f8f9fa; 
        color: #333;
        padding: 0; 
        margin: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        border-top: 5px solid #11809F;
        border-bottom: 5px solid #84B04C;
    }

    .container {
        background: #ffffff;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding: 30px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-align: center;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .logo-container {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
        max-width: 250px;
        height: auto;
    }

    .header-title {
        color: #11809F;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .divider {
        height: 3px;
        width: 50px;
        background-color: #F5B62A;
        margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
        border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .content { 
        font-size: 15px; 
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .faq-box {
        background-color: #f1f8f9;
        border-left: 4px solid #84B04C;
        padding: 15px;
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    }

    .faq-title {
        color: #11809F;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    .faq-q {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .faq-a {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    button { 
        padding: 12px 40px; 
        background-color: #11809F; 
        color: white; 
        border: none; 
        border-radius: 25px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer; 
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    button:hover { 
        background-color: #0c6179; 
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Logo Section -->
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="Apollo_Knowledge-logo-1-1.webp.bv.webp" alt="Apollo Knowledge Logo" class="logo">
        </div>

        <div class="header-title">Daily Network Announcement for Bedanta<br>Marketing specialist</div>
        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Welcome to the Apollo Knowledge network.</p>
            <p>This message is synced dynamically. Important updates, maintenance schedules, and daily briefings will appear here automatically upon logon.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- IT FAQ Section -->
        <div class="faq-box">
            <p class="faq-title">IT Quick Tip of the Day</p>
            <p class="faq-q">Q: How do I refresh my Windows Group Policy if I am missing a network printer or mapped drive?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">A: Press the Windows Key, type <strong>cmd</strong>, and press Enter. In the command prompt, type <code>gpupdate /force</code> and hit Enter. Once it says "Computer Policy update has completed successfully," restart your PC if prompted.</p>
        </div>
        
        <button onclick="window.close()">Acknowledge & Continue</button>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
